Package: corrector
Title: Automatic Grading of R Coding Exercises
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Pablo", "Vena", email = "vena.pablo@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Pablo Vena [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Pablo Vena <vena.pablo@gmail.com>
Description: Grades student R coding exercises against professor-written test
    functions. Accepts a directory or zip archive of submissions, matches each
    exercise file to its test file, runs the tests in a separate R process
    with a time limit, and returns one row per test with its status. Reads
    'Moodle' submission exports and accepts R Markdown and Quarto files.
    Provides partial-credit scores, summaries, plots, per-student feedback
    files, and export to CSV, HTML or Google Sheets.
